f-exclusion options, and access to responsible gambling support resources. Players should always gamble within their financial limits and seek professional assistance if gambling stops being enjoyable.</p>\n<h2>Our Editorial Assessment</h2>\n<p>After evaluating Lucky Vibe''s game selection, software partnerships, banking options, customer support, promotional offers, and overall user experience, our editorial team considers it a competitive choice for players looking for a modern online casino. Its broad cryptocurrency support, multilingual platform, and extensive provider network make it suitable for international audiences. Players should always review the latest promotional terms and verify that the casino is legally available in their jurisdiction before registering.</p>','\n',char(10)),'["Large welcome bonus worth up to €5,000","Supports cryptocurrencies","Huge selection of game providers","24/7 customer support","Many payment methods","Mobile-friendly website","Multiple languages available"]','["No dedicated mobile app","Withdrawal limit applies","Bonus wagering requirements apply","Restricted in some countries"]',4.8,'Lucky Vibe Casino Review 2026 – Bonus, Games, Payments & Safety','Read our independent Lucky Vibe Casino review covering the €5,000 welcome bonus, 300 free spins, game selection, payment methods, cryptocurrencies, licensing, withdrawal speed, security and overall player experience in 2026.',0,1,'2026-07-31 15:40:20','2026-07-31 15:59:04',replace('<p>Lucky Vibe Casino is an online casino launched in 2024 and operated by Hollycorn under a Cura&ccedil;ao gaming licence. The casino offers thousands of casino games from leading software providers, supports both fiat and cryptocurrency payments, and is available in multiple languages including English, German, Italian, Norwegian and French.</p>\n<p>New players can claim a welcome package worth up to &euro;5,000 and 300 Free Spins across their first four deposits. The platform focuses on desktop and mobile browser play, provides 24/7 customer support, and supports players from many international markets where online gambling is permitted.</p>','\n',char(10)),replace('<p>Lucky Vibe features a large gaming portfolio supplied by more than 100 software developers. Players can enjoy online slots, jackpot slots, live casino games, blackjack, roulette, baccarat, poker variants, crash games, instant-win games and virtual entertainment.</p>\n<p>Major providers include Pragmatic Play, Evolution, NetEnt, Red Tiger, Play''n GO, Playtech, BGaming, Hacksaw Gaming, Relax Gaming, Push Gaming, Quickspin, Wazdan, Yggdrasil, Spribe, Nolimit City, Thunderkick, Ezugi, BetGames and many more.</p>','\n',char(10)),replace('<p>Lucky Vibe welcomes new players with a four-part welcome package worth up to &euro;5,000 and 300 Free Spins. The first deposit receives a 100% bonus up to &euro;1,000 plus 100 Free Spins, followed by additional bonuses on the next three deposits.</p>\n<p>The casino also runs weekly reload promotions on Tuesday, Thursday, Friday and Sunday with bonus codes, deposit bonuses and free spins. Bonus offers are subject to wagering requirements, minimum deposits and maximum bet limits, so players should always review the bonus terms before participating.</p>','\n',char(10)),replace('<p>Lucky Vibe supports a wide range of payment methods including Visa and Mastercard, Apple Pay, Google Pay, Trustly, Skrill, Neteller, MiFinity, Jeton, MuchBetter, PIX, Interac, Rapid Transfer, Astropay, Paysafecard, Neosurf, Ecopayz, UPI, Bank Transfer and many local payment options.</p>\n<p>Cryptocurrency payments are also supported through CoinsPaid, including Bitcoin, Ethereum, Litecoin, Dogecoin, Tether, XRP, BNB, ADA, TRX and several other digital assets. The minimum deposit starts from &euro;20, while withdrawals are generally processed within 72 hours.</p>','\n',char(10)),replace('<p>Lucky Vibe operates under a Cura&ccedil;ao gaming licence and applies responsible gambling measures designed to help provide a secure gaming environment. Player verification may be required before withdrawals, and the casino uses encrypted connections to help protect customer information and payment transactions.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>As with any online casino, players should ensure the operator is legally available in their jurisdiction before registering.</p>','\n',char(10)),replace('[\n  {\n    "q": "Is Lucky Vibe Casino licensed?",\n    "a": "Yes. Lucky Vibe operates under a Curaçao gaming licence."\n  },\n  {\n    "q": "What is the Lucky Vibe welcome bonus?",\n    "a": "New players can receive up to €5,000 in bonuses and 300 Free Spins across their first four deposits, subject to the applicable terms and conditions."\n  },\n  {\n    "q": "Does Lucky Vibe accept cryptocurrency?",\n    "a": "Yes. Lucky Vibe supports several cryptocurrencies including Bitcoin, Ethereum, Litecoin, USDT, XRP, BNB, ADA, TRX and others."\n  },\n  {\n    "q": "How long do withdrawals take?",\n    "a": "Lucky Vibe states that withdrawals are generally processed within 72 hours after approval."\n  }\n]','\n',char(10)),replace('<p>Lucky Vibe is a modern online casino offering an extensive game library, generous welcome bonuses, cryptocurrency support and a broad selection of payment methods. Its multilingual platform and mobile compatibility make it suitable for international players.</p>\n<p>While daily withdrawal limits and bonus wagering conditions should be considered, Lucky Vibe delivers a competitive overall experience for players looking for slots, live casino games and crypto-friendly banking options.</p>','\n',char(10)),'Elie Bizimana',NULL,NULL,2,NULL,NULL);
