o review the bonus terms and wagering requirements before claiming the offer.</p>',replace('<p>The platform supports both cryptocurrency and traditional fiat payment methods, giving players flexible deposit and withdrawal options.</p>\n<p>Withdrawal times vary depending on the payment method selected.</p>','\n',char(10)),'<p>The casino operates under a Cura&ccedil;ao licence, although licensing may vary depending on the player''s jurisdiction.</p>',replace('[\n  {\n    "q": "Is BetAndYou Casino legitimate?",\n    "a": "BetAndYou states that it operates under a Curaçao licence, although licensing may vary depending on the player''s jurisdiction."\n  },\n  {\n    "q": "Does BetAndYou accept cryptocurrency?",\n    "a": "Yes. According to the operator, both cryptocurrency and traditional fiat payment methods are supported."\n  },\n  {\n    "q": "Does BetAndYou offer sports betting?",\n    "a": "Yes. BetAndYou includes a sportsbook alongside its online casino."\n  },\n  {\n    "q": "How fast are withdrawals?",\n    "a": "Withdrawal times depend on the payment method used and may vary."\n  },\n  {\n    "q": "Is BetAndYou available worldwide?",\n    "a": "The brand operates globally, but availability depends on local laws and regulations."\n  }\n]','\n',char(10)),'<p>BetAndYou combines casino gaming, sportsbook betting, and support for crypto and traditional payments in one platform. While additional information about supported countries, bonuses, game providers, and payment options is still pending, the brand shows potential for players seeking a global gaming experience. This review will be updated as more verified information becomes available.</p>','Elie Bizimana',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL);
