ting markets."\n  },\n  {\n    "q": "What payment methods does 1xBet support?",\n    "a": "The platform supports bank cards, e-wallets, bank transfers, cryptocurrencies, and numerous local payment methods, depending on your location."\n  },\n  {\n    "q": "Is 1xBet available worldwide?",\n    "a": "1xBet operates in many countries, but access and available services depend on local gambling laws and regulations."\n  }\n]','\n',char(10)),'<p>1xBet is a feature-rich gambling platform combining an extensive sportsbook, online casino, live dealer games, esports, and multiple payment options. With global coverage, mobile compatibility, and a large selection of betting markets, it appeals to both casino players and sports bettors. While availability and promotions vary by jurisdiction, 1xBet remains a strong choice for experienced players seeking a comprehensive gaming experience.</p>','Elie Bizimana',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "reviews" ("id","casino_slug","country_code","slug","title","content","pros","cons","rating","seo_title","seo_description","ai_generated","published","created_at","updated_at","overview","games","bonuses","payments","licenses","faq_json","verdict","author","author_title","reviewed_at","author_id","created_by","seo_keywords") VALUES(49,'vavada',NULL,'vavada-casino-review','VAVADA Casino Review 2026: Games, Bonuses, Payments, Crypto & Licensing',replace('<p>VAVADA at a glance</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Founded: 2017 Official website: vavada.com Operator: Vavada&nbsp; B.V.Licence: Cura&ccedil;ao&nbsp; OGL/2024/252/0153,&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;according to supplied operator information</p>\n<p>&nbsp;Games: 5,000+Casino&nbsp; formats: Slots, live casino, roulette, blackjack, baccarat, video poker and other games</p>\n<p>&nbsp;Cryptocurrency: BTC, ETH, LTC, USDT, USDC, TRX, TON and other supported assets</p>\n<p>Currencies: USD, EUR, RUB, UAH, TRY, KZT, BRL, MXN, SEK, HUF, PLN, JPY, KRW, AUD, RON, NOK, BYN, CAD, UZS, AZN and INR</p>\n<p>Languages: English, German, Bulgarian, Canadian English, Spanish, Finnish, Canadian French, Hungarian, Italian, Kazakh, Polish, Portuguese, Russian, Swedish, Turkish, Japanese, Korean, Uzbek, Azerbaijani, Greek and Hindi</p>\n<p>Support: 24/7 live chat, email and social/messaging channels</p>\n<p>Email: <a href="mailto:admin@vavada.net">admin@vavada.net</a></p>\n<p>Phone: +1 404 382 0303</p>\n<p>Withdrawal processing: stated as several minutes to 24 hours</p>\n<p>Cashback: 10% for eligible players</p>\n<p>Tournaments: Crypto tournaments, X-tournament, bonus tournaments, freespins tournaments and VAVADA internal jackpots Player rewards: Player status, tournaments, personal manager and increased withdrawal limits where applicable</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Responsible gambling should remain central to any casino experience. VAVADA is an online gambling service, and gambling involves financial risk. Players should only gamble with money they can afford to lose, follow their local laws and use available responsible-gambling controls.</p>','\n',char(10)),'["More than 5,000 games advertised","Large selection of major software providers","Strong cryptocurrency payment support","Wide range of traditional digital payment methods","Multiple supported fiat currencies","100 free spins registration promotion","100% first-deposit bonus available","10% cashback programme for eligible players","24/7 customer support","Live casino and table games","Multiple tournaments and internal jackpot formats","High cryptocurrency withdrawal limits advertised"]','["Not available in many countries","Curaçao licensing is not equivalent to UKGC or MGA regulation","Bonus terms include significant wagering requirements","Some promotions are GEO-specific","Verification may be requested before or during withdrawals","Payment options and game availability vary by jurisdiction","Withdrawal limits depend on player status"]',4.7,'VAVADA Casino Review 2026: 5,000+ Games, Bonuses & Crypto','VAVADA Casino Review 2026: explore 5,000+ games, bonuses, crypto payments, withdrawal times, licensing, supported countries, payment methods and our expert verdict.',0,1,'2026-08-10 23:05:07','2026-08-10 23:17:22',replace('<p>VAVADA is an established&nbsp; online casino that has operated since 2017, offering a large selection of slots, live casino games, table games, betting products and cryptocurrency payment options. The operator states that its catalogue contains more than 5,000 games, with software from major providers including Evolution, Pragmatic Play, Play&rsquo;n GO, NetEnt, Hacksaw Gaming, Nolimit City, BGaming, Quickspin, Relax Gaming, Yggdrasil and many others.</p>\n<p>One of VAVADA''s strongest features is its international approach. The platform supports numerous currencies and languages and provides a wide range of local payment methods alongside cryptocurrency deposits and withdrawals. Depending on the player''s jurisdiction, available options include cards, digital wallets, bank-transfer-style solutions and cryptocurrencies such as Bitcoin, Ethereum, Litecoin, USDT, USDC, TRON and TON.</p>\n<p>The casino also has a substantial promotional programme. New players can receive 100 free spins on The Dog House without making a deposit, subject to the applicable wagering terms. Certain markets have alternative registration promotions, while a 100% first-deposit bonus is also advertised with a 35x wagering requirement and a maximum cashout of 10 times the bonus amount. VAVADA also offers cashback, promotional codes, tournaments and player-status rewards.</p>\n<p>VAVADA is licensed under the Cura&ccedil;ao regulatory framework, with the supplied operator information identifying Vavada B.V. and licence number OGL/2024/252/0153. Players should understand that licensing and availability are jurisdiction-dependent and that VAVADA does not accept customers from a substantial list of restricted countries.</p>\n<p>Overall, VAVADA stands out for its enormous game library, cryptocurrency support, international payment infrastructure and variety of promotions. Its main limitations are the extensive country restrictions and the fact that its Cura&ccedil;ao licensing should not be confused with regulation by stricter national regulators such as the UK Gambling Commission or Malta Gaming Authority.</p>','\n',char(10)),replace('<p>VAVADA claims to offer more than 5,000 casino games, making game selection one of the platform''s main attractions. The catalogue covers online slots, live dealer games, roulette, blackjack, baccarat, video poker and other casino formats.</p>\n<p>The provider list is particularly broad. VAVADA''s supplied catalogue includes Evolution Gaming, Ezugi, Pragmatic Play, Play''n GO, NetEnt, Red Tiger, Nolimit City, Hacksaw Gaming, BGaming, Amusnet, Amatic, Betgames, Blueprint Gaming, BTG, Endorphina, ELK, Fantasma, Gamomat, Games Global, iSoftBet, Jili, Kalamba, Light &amp; Wonder-related catalogue entries where available, Novomatic, Octoplay, Peter &amp; Sons, PG Soft, Playtech, Push Gaming, Quickspin, Relax Gaming, Slotmill, SmartSoft, Spribe, TaDa Gaming, Three Oaks Gaming, Thunderkick, Turbo Games and Yggdrasil.</p>\n<p>There is also a selection of less familiar and proprietary-style providers, giving the catalogue additional depth beyond the biggest mainstream studios.</p>\n<p>For slot players, the combination of established studios and newer developers provides access to classic reels, modern video slots, high-volatility titles, jackpots and crash-style games. Players interested in live casino can also find dealer-led formats such as blackjack, roulette and baccarat, depending on jurisdiction and availability.</p>\n<p>The large catalogue is a genuine strength, although the exact games and providers available can vary according to the player''s country, currency and regulatory restrictions.</p>','\n',char(10)),replace('<p>VAVADA has a multi-part bonus programme rather than relying on a single welcome promotion.</p>\n<p>The standard registration offer supplied for this review is 100 free spins on The Dog House. The bonus does not require an initial deposit to activate. The free spins use a minimum bet of $0.20, and winnings from the spins are subject to a 20x wagering requirement. The bonus must be activated from the Bonuses section after registration.</p>\n<p>An important detail is that VAVADA states that winnings generated during the wagering process are credited as real-money winnings rather than being restricted to the original bonus balance. Players should nevertheless read the applicable bonus terms before playing because promotions can be market-specific.</p>\n<p>For Indian players, the supplied promotion differs: VAVADA advertises 100 free rounds in Aviamasters with a minimum bet of 10 INR instead of the standard registration free-spin offer.</p>\n<p>VAVADA also advertises a 100% first-deposit bonus. The bonus equals the player''s first deposit and carries a 35x wagering requirement. The supplied terms state that the maximum win when wagering only bonus funds is 10 times the bonus amount. The first-deposit bonus is cancelled when a withdrawal is requested.</p>\n<p>Another feature is cashback. VAVADA states that eligible players can receive 10% cashback, calculated from the difference between total bets and winnings, after previously paid cashback is taken into account. Cashback is credited on the first day of the month and has a 5x wagering requirement, according to the supplied bonus information.</p>\n<p>The casino also promotes birthday bonuses, promotional codes, raffles, free bonuses, tournaments and player-status rewards. Only one bonus can normally be active at a time, except for bonuses held in different currencies, and bonus wagering is generally subject to a 14-day period.</p>\n<p>Because bonus availability can differ by GEO, Level.casino recommends checking the exact promotion displayed in the player''s account before depositing.</p>','\n',char(10)),replace('<p>VAVADA has one of the broader payment infrastructures in its supplied market coverage, supporting both traditional digital payment methods and cryptocurrencies.</p>\n<p>Deposit methods include MuchBetter, Jeton, Papara, Skrill, Neteller, Rapid Transfer, Google Pay, UPI, PhonePe, Paytm, IMPS, PIX, Blik, eParaTR, VouWallet, m10, eManat, Mkarekod and other region-specific payment solutions.</p>\n<p>The minimum deposit varies significantly by currency. Examples supplied by the operator include 1 EUR, 1 USD, 50 RUB, 20 UAH, 300 KZT, 5 BRL, 7 TRY, 20 MXN, 5 PLN, 400 HUF, 10 SEK, 130 JPY, 2 AUD, 10 NOK, 5 RON, 3 BYN, 1 CAD, 12,500 UZS, 3 AZN and 300 INR.</p>\n<p>Cryptocurrency deposits are also supported. The supplied list includes Bitcoin, Ethereum, Litecoin, USDT on ERC20, TRC20 and BEP20 networks, TRON, TON, USDC on ERC20 and BEP20, Binance and other supported crypto networks.</p>\n<p>Withdrawals are available through many of the same traditional payment channels, while the cryptocurrency withdrawal list is substantially broader. Supported crypto options supplied for the review include BTC, ETH, LTC, USDT, USDC, TRON, TON, Binance, Optimism-network assets and various BEP20 and ERC20 tokens.</p>\n<p>The minimum withdrawal depends on the currency and payment method. Examples include 15 EUR, 15 USD, 1,000 RUB, 385 UAH, 5,700 KZT, 75 BRL, 150 TRY, 300 MXN, 68 PLN, 5,700 HUF, 150 SEK, 2,000 JPY, 30 AUD, 150 NOK, 75 RON, 50 BYN, 30 CAD, 60,000 UZS, 50 AZN and 1,000 INR.</p>\n<p>VAVADA states that withdrawals are processed around the clock, including weekends, with payments generally taking from several minutes up to 24 hours after a withdrawal request. Actual processing times can depend on the selected method, account checks and other operational factors.</p>\n<p>The operator also states that withdrawals may be subject to verification. Identity verification is not necessarily mandatory before every withdrawal but can be requested at any time.</p>\n<p>Withdrawal limits depend on player status, with supplied limits ranging from $1,000 to $10,000 per day and $10,000 to $100,000 per month. Cryptocurrency limits can reach up to $1 million per month, according to the supplied information.</p>','\n',char(10)),replace('<p>VAVADA is identified in the supplied operator information as being operated by Vavada B.V. under Cura&ccedil;ao licence number OGL/2024/252/0153.</p>\n<p>Players should distinguish this from regulation by national gambling authorities such as the UK Gambling Commission or the Malta Gaming Authority. Cura&ccedil;ao introduced a substantially revised online gambling framework through the National Ordinance on Games of Chance (LOK), which entered into force on 24 December 2024. The Cura&ccedil;ao Gaming Authority states that operators offering online gaming in or from Cura&ccedil;ao must obtain an online gaming licence under the new framework.</p>\n<p>For this reason, players should check the current licensing information shown on VAVADA itself and confirm that the service is legally available in their jurisdiction before registering or depositing.</p>\n<p>VAVADA does not accept customers from numerous restricted jurisdictions. The supplied exclusion list includes the United Kingdom, Germany, Georgia, the Netherlands, Portugal, Slovakia, the United States, France, Austria, Belgium, Sweden, Spain, Switzerland, Cyprus and many other countries and territories.</p>\n<p>The restricted list also includes several African markets, including Burundi, Democratic Republic of the Congo, Ethiopia, Nigeria, Uganda and Zimbabwe, among others.</p>\n<p>A VAVADA account should therefore never be treated as automatically available worldwide simply because the website supports many currencies and languages.</p>','\n',char(10)),'[ { "q": "Is VAVADA a legitimate online casino?", "a": "VAVADA is an established international online casino operating since 2017. The supplied operator information identifies Vavada B.V. and Curaçao licence OGL/2024/252/0153. Players should verify the current licence information on the operator''s website and confirm that VAVADA is legally available in their jurisdiction before registering." }, { "q": "How many games does VAVADA have?", "a": "VAVADA states that it offers more than 5,000 games. Its catalogue includes slots, live dealer games, roulette, blackjack, baccarat, video poker and other casino formats from a large range of software providers." }, { "q": "What is the VAVADA welcome bonus?", "a": "The supplied standard registration promotion provides 100 free spins on The Dog House without requiring an initial deposit. The free spins carry a 20x wagering requirement and use a minimum bet of $0.20. Promotions can vary by country, so players should check the bonus shown in their account." }, { "q": "Does VAVADA support cryptocurrency?", "a": "Yes. VAVADA supports multiple cryptocurrencies, including Bitcoin, Ethereum, Litecoin, TRON, TON, USDT and USDC across several supported blockchain networks. The exact payment options depend on the player''s currency and jurisdiction." }, { "q": "What is the minimum deposit at VAVADA?", "a": "The minimum deposit depends on the currency and payment method. Supplied examples include 1 USD, 1 EUR, 50 RUB, 20 MXN, 300 INR and 2 AUD. The applicable minimum is displayed when selecting a payment method." }, { "q": "How long do VAVADA withdrawals take?", "a": "VAVADA states that payments are processed around the clock, including weekends, and can take from several minutes up to 24 hours after a withdrawal request. Actual timing can vary by payment method and account verification requirements." }, { "q": "Does VAVADA require identity verification?", "a": "Verification is not necessarily mandatory before every withdrawal according to the supplied operator information, but VAVADA may request verification at any time. Players should be prepared to provide the requested documentation if an account check is triggered." }, { "q": "What countries does VAVADA not accept?", "a": "VAVADA has a substantial restricted-country list. It includes markets such as the United Kingdom, Germany, United States, France, Austria, Belgium, Sweden, Spain, Switzerland, Cyprus, Portugal and many others. The list also includes numerous African, Asian and Caribbean jurisdictions. Players must check the current eligibility rules before registering." }, { "q": "Does VAVADA offer cashback?", "a": "VAVADA states that eligible players can receive 10% cashback. The supplied formula is based on bets minus winnings, adjusted for previously paid cashback. Cashback is credited on the first day of the month and carries a 5x wagering requirement." }, { "q": "Is VAVADA available on mobile?", "a": "VAVADA is positioned as an international online and mobile casino. Players can access the service through compatible mobile devices, although game and payment availability can vary by operating system, browser and jurisdiction." }, { "q": "Is VAVADA available in the United States?", "a": "No. The supplied VAVADA restricted-country information lists the United States among jurisdictions that are not accepted." }, { "q": "Can I play at VAVADA with cryptocurrency?", "a": "Yes. Cryptocurrency is one of VAVADA''s major payment options. Supported assets supplied for this review include BTC, ETH, LTC, USDT, USDC, TRX, TON and Binance-related payment options, with additional network-specific assets available for withdrawals." } ]',replace('<p>VAVADA is a strong option for players looking for a large international casino with extensive game coverage, cryptocurrency support and a broad selection of payment methods.</p>\n<p>Its biggest advantage is scale. With a stated catalogue of more than 5,000 games and a long list of established software providers, the platform offers considerably more variety than a small casino focused on a handful of studios. The payment infrastructure is another major strength, particularly for crypto users and players in markets where local digital wallets and payment systems are important.</p>\n<p>The bonus programme is also competitive, especially the 100 free spins registration offer and the 100% first-deposit promotion. However, players should pay close attention to wagering requirements, maximum cashout provisions, bonus expiry periods and GEO-specific conditions before accepting any promotion.</p>\n<p>The main consideration is regulation and geographic availability. VAVADA operates under the Cura&ccedil;ao framework rather than the stricter regulatory regimes found in some major European markets, and the casino excludes a substantial number of countries. Players should therefore verify eligibility before registering.</p>\n<p>For eligible international players, particularly those interested in slots, crypto payments and a large multi-provider catalogue, VAVADA deserves consideration. Its combination of game depth, payment flexibility, promotions and 24/7 support gives it a well-rounded profile, although responsible gambling and local legal requirements should always come first.</p>','\n',char(10)),'Elie Bizimana',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "reviews" ("id","casino_slug","country_code","slug","title","content","pros","cons","rating","seo_title","seo_description","ai_generated","published","created_at","updated_at","overview","games","bonuses","payments","licenses","faq_json","verdict","author","author_title","reviewed_at","author_id","created_by","seo_keywords") VALUES(50,'spinko',NULL,'spinko-casino-review','Spinko Casino Review 2026: 10,000+ Games, Bonuses, Crypto & Payments',replace('<p>Why Spinko stands out</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Spinko''s strongest proposition is not one individual feature but the combination of several mature casino components.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>First is the catalogue. More than 10,000 published games give the platform enough depth for players with very different preferences. Slots dominate the selection, but live casino, jackpots, table games, minigames and tournament content provide alternatives.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Second is payment localisation. Instead of offering the same small list of payment methods everywhere, Spinko adjusts its cashier according to the player''s country. This includes Interac Online in Canada, local payment services in Portugal, regional banking and e-wallet solutions across Europe, and multiple crypto options.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Third is the international focus. Spinko supports several European markets as well as Canada, Australia and New Zealand. Its language and currency coverage reinforces that international positioning.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Finally, the VIP programme adds another layer for regular players, with higher withdrawal limits, better cashback percentages, improved exchange rates, exclusive offers and personal-manager access at qualifying levels.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Players should nevertheless approach every bonus carefully. A &euro;2,200 headline package can look attractive, but the 40x bonus wagering requirement means the actual value depends heavily on the amount deposited, bonus received and wagering conditi