, Revolut, Wise, N26, Skrill, Neteller, Paysafecard, Mifinity, Open Banking, Binance Pay, Bybit Pay and other regional services. Cryptocurrency deposits and withdrawals include Bitcoin, Ethereum, Litecoin, Tether, Tron and USDC.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Spinko''s software portfolio is equally broad. The supplied catalogue includes major studios such as Evolution, Pragmatic Play, NetEnt, Hacksaw Gaming, Play''n GO, Push Gaming, Quickspin, Relax Gaming, Yggdrasil, Nolimit City, BGaming, Red Tiger, Spribe, Amusnet and many more.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The casino is available through a web app and supports a range of international currencies and languages. The supplied accepted GEO list includes Germany, Portugal, Poland, Italy, Canada, Australia, New Zealand, Switzerland, Greece, Sweden, Norway, Finland, Hungary, Lithuania, Latvia and Austria, although availability should always be confirmed at registration because regulatory restrictions can change.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Spinko states that it is licensed by the Cura&ccedil;ao Gaming Authority under licence OGL/2024/112/0974, with the licence effective from 24 June 2025 under Cura&ccedil;ao''s National Ordinance on Games of Chance (LOK).</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>For players in supported markets, Spinko''s combination of game depth, local payment options, cryptocurrency support and VIP benefits makes it an interesting casino to consider. However, players should check the current terms, eligible GEOs, bonus conditions and licensing information before depositing.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>SPORTSBOOK</strong></p>\n<p>Spinko also lists sportsbook functionality alongside its casino products.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>This means the platform is not limited to casino games and can provide users with a broader gambling offering. Sportsbook availability, markets and betting products can vary by jurisdiction, so players should check what is actually available in their account.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Level.casino evaluates Spinko primarily as an online casino and casino affiliate destination rather than as a dedicated sportsbook.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>VIP PROGRAM</strong></p>\n<p>Spinko offers a multi-level VIP programme designed to provide additional benefits to returning players.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>According to the supplied information, VIP members can receive exclusive offers and special privileges in addition to the casino''s standard promotions.</p>\n<p>Benefits can include:</p>\n<p>Higher withdrawal limits</p>\n<p>Increased cashback percentages</p>\n<p>Better exchange rates</p>\n<p>Exclusive promotions</p>\n<p>A personal VIP manager at qualifying levels</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The exact benefits depend on the player''s VIP level. Spinko does not provide a single universal VIP package applicable to every customer, so players should review the benefits associated with their individual account level.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>MOBILE CASINO</strong></p>\n<p>Spinko is available through a web app, allowing players to access the casino from compatible mobile devices without relying on a separate native application.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The web-based approach provides access to casino content through a mobile browser while retaining the main platform''s account and cashier infrastructure.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Game compatibility can vary by title and device. Players should use an up-to-date browser and confirm that their chosen payment method is supported on mobile.</p>','\n',char(10)),replace('<p>Spinko''s game selection is one of the strongest parts of the platform. The supplied casino data lists 10,147 published games in total, including 8,020 slots, 751 live casino games, 924 jackpot games, 188 table games, 56 minigames, 262 new games, 104 popular games, 213 bonus games and 30 tournament categories.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The sheer size of the catalogue means Spinko is not limited to a small selection of mainstream slots. Players can browse established casino releases alongside newer titles, jackpot games, live dealer products and smaller specialist categories.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The slot catalogue includes games from major studios such as Pragmatic Play, Hacksaw Gaming, Play''n GO, NetEnt, Nolimit City, Quickspin, Push Gaming, Relax, Yggdrasil, BGaming, Red Tiger, Thunderkick, Spinomenal, Playson, Wazdan, Amusnet, Habanero, Booming Games, SmartSoft, Spribe and many others.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The live casino section includes major providers such as Evolution, Pragmatic Live, Vivo Gaming, SA Gaming, Creedroomz, LiveGames, TVBet and others. Depending on the player''s GEO, this can provide access to live roulette, blackjack, baccarat and other dealer-led formats.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Spinko also lists crash, instant-win and minigame-style content from providers such as Aviatrix, Turbo Games, Galaxsys and SmartSoft.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The exact games available can vary by country because Spinko applies GEO restrictions and local regulatory requirements. Therefore, the published catalogue should be viewed as the overall platform selection rather than a guarantee that every title will appear for every player.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>GAME PROVIDERS</strong></p>\n<p>Spinko''s provider portfolio is unusually broad for a newer casino brand.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The supplied provider list includes:</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1spin4win, 1x2, Amatic, Amusnet, Apollo, AsiaGaming, AvatarUX, Aviatrix, Barbarabang, BeeFee, Belatra, BetGames, Betradar, BetSoft, BGaming, Booming Games, Concept Gaming, Creedroomz, ELK Studios, Endorphina, EvoPlay, Fugaso Gaming, Galaxsys, GameArt, Gamzix, Golden Race, Habanero, Hacksaw Gaming, HoGaming, Igrosoft, InOut, IronDog Studio, KA Gaming, Kiron, LiveGames, LuckyStreak, Mancala, Mascot, Merkur, NetGame, NetEnt, Novomatic, Pascal Gaming, Penguin King, Peter &amp; Sons, Platipus, Playson, PopiPlay, Popok Gaming, Pragmatic Live, Pragmatic Play, Push Gaming, Quickspin, RAW Games, RedRake, Relax Gaming, SA Gaming, Salsa Technology, Simple Play, SmartSoft, Spinmatic, Spinocchio, Spinomenal, Spribe, The Hood, Three Oaks Gaming, Thunderkick, Tom Horn Gaming, Turbo Games, TVBet, Vivo Gaming, VoltEnt, Winfinity, Winspinity, XPG and Yggdrasil.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>This gives Spinko exposure to both traditional slots and modern formats such as crash games, live casino, virtual betting and instant games.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>','\n',char(10)),replace('<p>Spinko promotes a multi-stage welcome package advertised at up to &euro;2,200 plus 350 free spins.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The supplied welcome programme is structured across the first five deposits.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>On the first deposit, players can receive a 100% bonus plus 100 free spins for Wanted Dead or a Wild from Hacksaw Gaming. The first-deposit bonus has a maximum of &euro;500, with equivalent limits listed for supported currencies.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The second deposit provides 50 free spins in Razor Returns from Push Gaming, with the supplied promotion listing a maximum bonus amount of &euro;200.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The third deposit offers a 70% bonus plus 100 free spins in Duel at Dawn from Hacksaw Gaming, with a maximum bonus of &euro;500.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The fourth deposit offers a 50% bonus up to &euro;500.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The fifth deposit provides another 100% bonus plus 100 free spins in Pirate Bonanza from Hacksaw Gaming, with a maximum bonus of &euro;500.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>According to the supplied terms, the minimum qualifying deposit starts at &euro;25 and varies by currency. The listed minimums include C$35, 280 kr, 110 zł, 9,700 HUF, NZ$45, A$40, 25 CHF and 185 DKK.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The maximum bonus bet is also restricted while wagering. The supplied limits include &euro;5, C$7, 50 kr, 20 zł, 1,800 HUF, NZ$8, A$8, 5 CHF and 40 DKK, depending on currency.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The stated wagering requirements are:</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Bonus: 40x</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Free spins: 35x</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>These requirements are important. A large headline bonus does not necessarily mean a player can withdraw the funds immediately. Players should read the complete promotion terms before accepting a bonus, particularly the wagering rules, maximum-bet restrictions, expiry provisions and eligible games.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Spinko also states that affiliate partners can request exclusive first-deposit bonuses, no-deposit promotions and giveaways. Availability of such offers depends on the specific campaign and GEO.</p>','\n',char(10)),replace('<p>Payment flexibility is one of Spinko''s most notable features.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The casino uses a combination of international e-wallets, cards, banking services, mobile payment systems and cryptocurrency. The exact selection depends on the player''s GEO.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>For Greece, the supplied deposit options include Binance Pay, Bybit Pay, cards, Flexepin, N26, Revolut, Wise, Apple Pay, Google Pay, Open Banking, Skrill, Neteller, Paysafecard and cryptocurrency. Withdrawal options include Bitcoin, Ethereum, Litecoin, Skrill, Tether, Tron and USDC.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Portugal players have access to local options such as Volt PT, MB WAY, Multibanco-style banking options, Rapid Transfer and regional payment services, alongside cards, e-wallets and cryptocurrency.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Swedish customers can use services including Apple Pay, Google Pay, Volt, Binance Pay, Bybit Pay, cards, Flexepin, N26, Revolut, Wise, Mifinity, Neteller, Paysafecard and crypto deposits. Withdrawals include Bitcoin, Ethereum, Litecoin, Mifinity, Tether, Tron and USDC.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Canadian payment coverage includes Apple Pay, Binance Pay, CashtoCode, cards, Gigadat Interac Online, Google Pay, Mifinity, Neteller, Paysafecard, Skrill and cryptocurrency. Canadian withdrawals include Bitcoin, Ethereum, Interac Online, Litecoin, Mifinity, Tether, Tron and USDC.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Australian players can use cards, Apple Pay, Google Pay, Binance Pay, Bybit Pay, CashtoCode, Flexepin, Mifinity, Neteller, Paysafecard, Skrill and cryptocurrency, while withdrawal options include Bitcoin, Ethereum, Litecoin, Inpay AUD, Mifinity, Tether, Tron and USDC.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Other supported GEOs&mdash;including Germany, Denmark, Finland, Norway, Italy, Switzerland, Poland, Hungary, Lithuania and Latvia&mdash;also have combinations of cards, Open Banking, Revolut, Wise, N26, Mifinity, Skrill, Neteller, Paysafecard, Rapid Transfer and local banking services.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Crypto support includes:</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Bitcoin</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Ethereum</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Litecoin</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Tether</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Tron</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>USDC</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Because payment availability is GEO-dependent, players should use the cashier displayed in their own account rather than relying solely on a general payment list.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>WITHDRAWALS</strong></p>\n<p>Spinko positions fast withdrawals as one of its key selling points and states that the brand focuses on lightning-fast payouts.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>However, withdrawal processing should not be treated as a guaranteed fixed-time service. Actual processing can depend on the payment method, GEO, transaction checks and any required account verification.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The withdrawal infrastructure includes both fiat and cryptocurrency options. Depending on location, players can withdraw through services such as Skrill, Neteller, Mifinity, Rapid Transfer, Interac Online and local banking solutions, as well as Bitcoin, Ethereum, Litecoin, Tether, Tron and USDC.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Players should also be aware that Spinko may request verification as part of its AML and player-protection procedures. Completing verification when requested can be necessary before certain transactions are processed.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>CRYPTO CASINO</strong></p>\n<p>Spinko has a meaningful cryptocurrency component rather than treating crypto as a secondary payment option.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Bitcoin, Ethereum and Litecoin are supported, alongside stablecoins and other blockchain-based payment options including Tether, Tron and USDC. Binance Pay and Bybit Pay are also available in several GEOs.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Crypto support is particularly useful for players who prefer blockchain-based deposits or withdrawals and want to avoid relying exclusively on traditional banking systems.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Nevertheless, cryptocurrency transactions involve their own risks, including network fees, exchange-rate volatility and irreversible transfers. Players should confirm the selected blockchain network before sending funds and should never send cryptocurrency to an address without checking the payment instructions carefully.</p>','\n',char(10)),replace('<p>Spinko states that it is licensed by the Cura&ccedil;ao Gaming Authority under licence number OGL/2024/112/0974.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>According to the supplied information, the licence became effective on 24 June 2025 and permits the operator to offer games of chance under Cura&ccedil;ao''s National Ordinance on Games of Chance (LOK).</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The Cura&ccedil;ao framework is an important distinction for players. A Cura&ccedil;ao licence does not mean that a casino is licensed by the UK Gambling Commission, Malta Gaming Authority or another national regulator. Regulatory standards and player-protection frameworks differ between jurisdictions.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Spinko also maintains an extensive restricted-country policy. The supplied restricted list includes, among others, Afghanistan, Algeria, Austria, Belgium, Belarus, France, Hungary, Iran, Iraq, Kuwait, Moldova, the Netherlands, Nigeria, Pakistan, Qatar, Russia, Spain, Ukraine, the United Kingdom, the United States and Venezuela, together with various territories and other restricted jurisdictions.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The operator''s GEO lists should therefore be checked before registration. A country appearing in a general marketing or payment list does not automatically mean every customer in that country is eligible.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>RESPONSIBLE GAMBLING</strong></p>\n<p>Spinko provides a dedicated responsible-gambling policy and player-protection information.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Players should treat gambling as entertainment rather than a way to generate income. Setting personal limits, avoiding chasing losses and taking breaks can help keep gambling within manageable boundaries.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Spinko''s responsible-gambling information is available through its dedicated responsible-gaming section. Players who believe gambling is becoming difficult to control should seek appropriate professional or support services and use any account restrictions or responsible-gambling tools available to them.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Level.casino does not encourage players to gamble beyond their means.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>KYC &amp; AML</strong></p>\n<p>Spinko maintains an AML policy and may require customers to complete identity or source-of-funds checks as part of its compliance procedures.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Verification can be requested when registering, depositing, withdrawing or when account activity triggers additional compliance checks. Players should therefore use accurate personal information and be prepared to provide legitimate documentation when requested.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The exact verification requirements can vary according to the player''s circumstances and jurisdiction.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Completing KYC should not automatically be viewed as a negative feature. For a regulated gambling service, identity and anti-money-laundering checks are an important part of financial and player-protection procedures.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>CUSTOMER SUPPORT</strong></p>\n<p>Spinko provides 24/7 live-chat support and lists support@spinko.me as its customer-service email address.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Around-the-clock live chat is useful for payment questions, account issues, bonus queries and technical problems, particularly because Spinko serves multiple international markets.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Players should use the support channel associated with their account and provide relevant transaction or account information when requesting assistance.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>LANGUAGES &amp; CURRENCIES</strong></p>\n<p>Spinko supports an international customer base.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The supplied language list includes:</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>English</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>German</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Finnish</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Portuguese</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Italian</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Norwegian</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Polish</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Greek</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Hungarian</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Supported currencies include:</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>EUR</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>CAD</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>SEK</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>PLN</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>AUD</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>NZD</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>CHF</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>HUF</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The availability of a particular currency depends on the player''s GEO and account configuration.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>ACCEPTED COUNTRIES</strong> The supplied Spinko GEO information lists the following supported markets:</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Germany, Portugal, Poland, Italy, Canada, Austria, Australia, New Zealand, Switzerland, Greece, Sweden, Norway, Finland, Hungary, Lithuania and Latvia.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>This should not be interpreted as a permanent guarantee of availability. Gambling regulations and operator policies can change, and the final eligibility decision is made according to the operator''s current registration and compliance rules.</p>','\n',char(10)),'[{"q": "Is Spinko Casino legitimate?","a": "Spinko st