ing."},{"q": "Is Spinko available in Australia?","a": "Australia is included in the supplied accepted GEO list. The listed Australian payment options include cards, Apple Pay, Google Pay, Binance Pay, Bybit Pay, CashtoCode, Flexepin, Mifinity, Neteller, Paysafecard, Skrill and cryptocurrency."},{"q": "Does Spinko offer a VIP programme?","a": "Yes. Spinko has multiple VIP levels with additional benefits such as exclusive offers, higher withdrawal limits, increased cashback percentages, improved exchange rates and personal-manager access at qualifying levels."},{"q": "Does Spinko have a mobile casino?","a": "Yes. Spinko is available as a web app, allowing players to access the platform through compatible mobile devices and browsers without relying on a separate native application."},{"q": "Does Spinko offer sports betting?","a": "Yes. Spinko''s supplied platform information indicates that sportsbook functionality is available alongside its casino products. The exact sports and betting markets depend on the player''s jurisdiction."},{"q": "Does Spinko have 24/7 customer support?","a": "Yes. Spinko provides 24/7 live-chat support and lists support@spinko.me as its customer-support email address."},{"q": "Does Spinko require KYC verification?","a": "Spinko maintains an AML policy and can request identity or other compliance documentation. Verification requirements can depend on account activity, payment transactions and the player''s jurisdiction."},{"q": "Which countries are restricted at Spinko?","a": "Spinko has a substantial restricted-country list that includes markets such as the United Kingdom, United States, France, Spain, Netherlands, Russia, Ukraine, Hungary, Austria, Belgium and others. Players should check the current operator terms because restrictions can change."}]',replace('<p>Spinko is an impressive international casino for players who value game variety and payment flexibility.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Its biggest differentiator is the scale of its catalogue. The supplied platform data lists 10,147 published games, including more than 8,000 slots and hundreds of live, jackpot and table games. The provider portfolio covers many of the industry''s best-known studios, from Evolution and Pragmatic Play to Hacksaw Gaming, Play''n GO, NetEnt, Nolimit City, Quickspin, Push Gaming and Yggdrasil.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Payment coverage is another major strength. Spinko combines cards and traditional banking with Revolut, Wise, N26, Apple Pay, Google Pay, Skrill, Neteller, Mifinity, Open Banking and country-specific solutions. Crypto users can also access Bitcoin, Ethereum, Litecoin, Tether, Tron and USDC, with Binance Pay and Bybit Pay available in selected markets.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The welcome package is substantial, reaching a stated &euro;2,200 plus 350 free spins across five deposits. The downside is that the promotional requirements are relatively demanding, with bonus wagering listed at 40x and free-spin wagering at 35x. Players should therefore calculate the practical value of a promotion rather than judging it solely by the headline amount.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Spinko''s Cura&ccedil;ao licence provides a regulatory framework, but it should not be presented as equivalent to licensing from stricter national regulators. The casino also has a substantial restricted-country list, making GEO eligibility an important consideration.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Overall, Spinko earns a 4.4/5 from Level.casino based on the supplied game catalogue, provider coverage, payment infrastructure, promotional programme, VIP offering and international accessibility. It is particularly interesting for players who want a large casino library and multiple fiat and cryptocurrency payment choices, provided the service is legally available in their jurisdiction.</p>','\n',char(10)),'Elie Bizimana',NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL);
