ular players because the value of the programme is not limited to promotional bonuses. Higher limits, better cashback and personal account management can become more important as activity increases.</p>\n<p>Players should review the current VIP terms rather than assuming that every level provides the same benefits.</p>\n<p><strong>MOBILE CASINO</strong> CasaBet is available through a web app, giving users access from compatible mobile browsers without requiring a separate native casino application.</p>\n<p>The web-app approach makes the casino accessible across modern smartphones and tablets while keeping the main casino, account and payment functions in one environment.</p>\n<p>Individual game compatibility can vary between devices and browsers. Players should keep their mobile browser updated for the best experience.</p>','\n',char(10)),replace('<p>CasaBet''s game catalogue contains 8,005 listed games according to the supplied platform data, giving it enough depth to compete with established international casino brands.</p>\n<p>Slots form the largest category, with 1,459 titles listed. The casino also has 503 live casino games, 161 jackpot games, 149 table games and 15 minigames.</p>\n<p>For players who prefer newer releases, CasaBet lists 69 new games and 58 popular games. There are also 13 bonus games and 21 tournament categories.</p>\n<p>The slot catalogue covers several major game styles, from traditional video slots and jackpot titles to modern high-volatility releases, branded games, instant-win products and feature-heavy video slots.</p>\n<p>Major studios represented in the supplied provider catalogue include Pragmatic Play, Evolution, Play''n GO, NetEnt, Hacksaw Gaming, Nolimit City, Push Gaming, Quickspin, Yggdrasil, BGaming, Amusnet Interactive, Red Tiger, Thunderkick, Playson, Wazdan, Spinomenal, Habanero, Booming Games, SmartSoft, Spribe, Turbo Games and many others.</p>\n<p>CasaBet also has a significant live casino presence. Evolution, Pragmatic Live