p with casino reviews, listings, and industry collaborations.',0,1,'2026-07-07 01:59:53','2026-07-31 19:34:36',1,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "pages" ("id","slug","type","template","title","content_json","seo_title","seo_description","ai_generated","published","created_at","updated_at","author_id","created_by","seo_keywords") VALUES(8,'terms','page','page','Terms & Conditions','{"text":"<p>Welcome to <strong>Level.casino</strong>. These Terms and Conditions (\"Terms\") constitute a legal agreement between you (\"User\") and the Level.casino platform (\"the Portal\"). By accessing or using this digital portal, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to be bound by these Terms.</p>\n<h2>1. Independent Information Portal</h2>\n<p>Level.casino operates as a strictly independent digital portal. We provide comparative information, rankings, and reviews of third-party online gaming and gambling services. <strong>Level.casino is not a gambling operator</strong>, does not provide gambling services directly, and does not process financial transactions related to betting or gaming.</p>\n<h2>2. Acceptance of Terms</h2>\n<p>By using this Portal, you signify your irrevocable acceptance of these Terms. If you do not agree with any part of these Terms, you must immediately terminate your use of the Portal. We reserve the right to update these Terms at any time without prior notice.</p>\n<h2>3. User Responsibility &amp; Compliance</h2>\n<p>You are solely responsible for ensuring that your access to and use of Level.casino and any third-party websites linked herein complies with all laws and regulations applicable to you in your jurisdiction.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You must be of legal age (18+ in most jurisdictions).</li>\n<li>You must ensure online gambling is legal in your current location.</li>\n<li>The Portal is for informational and entertainment purposes only.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>4. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>\n<p>The design, code, ranking systems, and content featured on Level.casino are the exclusive intellectual property of the Portal. You are granted a limited, non-exclusive license to view the content for personal, non-commercial use only. Any unauthorized reproduction or distribution is strictly prohibited.</p>\n<h2>5. Third-Party Links &amp; Affiliate Disclosure</h2>\n<p>This Portal contains links to third-party websites. These links are provided for convenience and information. Level.casino may receive compensation from the operators listed on this site via affiliate partnerships.</p>\n<p>Please be aware that Level.casino has no control over the content, privacy policies, or practices of third-party sites. Once you leave this Portal, you are subject to the terms and conditions of the destination website.</p>\n<h2>6. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>\n<p>The information on Level.casino is provided \"as is.\" While we strive for accuracy, the Portal makes no warranties, expressed or implied, regarding the reliability, completeness, or timeliness of the information provided, including bonus offers, wagering requirements, or casino availability.</p>\n<h2>7. Limitation of Liability</h2>\n<p>Level.casino and its administrators shall not be held liable for any losses, damages, or disputes arising from your use of the Portal or any third-party website linked from it. This includes, but is not limited to, financial losses incurred through gambling activities. Users are encouraged to <strong>Play Responsibly</strong>.</p>\n<h2>8. Termination of Use</h2>\n<p>We reserve the right to restrict or terminate your access to the Portal at our sole discretion, without notice, for conduct that we believe violates these Terms or is harmful to other users or the integrity of the Portal.</p>\n<h2>9. Contact</h2>\n<p>For inquiries regarding these Terms or the operations of this digital portal, please contact: <a href=\"mailto:info@level.casino\">info@level.casino</a></p>"}','Terms & Conditions | Level.casino','Terms and Conditions for Level.casino. Read our rules, disclaimers, and user agreements for our independent casino ranking portal.',0,1,'2026-07-11 19:19:46','2026-08-09 23:08:52',2,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "pages" ("id","slug","type","template","title","content_json","seo_title","seo_description","ai_generated","published","created_at","updated_at","author_id","created_by","seo_keywords") VALUES(9,'about-us','page','page','About Level.casino','{"text":"<p>Level.casino is an independent online casino research, comparison and industry news platform. We analyze the iGaming landscape to help readers research casino brands, games, bonuses, payments, licensing, player-facing features and market developments across international markets.</p>\n<div class=\"about-grid\">\n<div class=\"about-card\">\n<h2>Our Mission</h2>\n<p>The online gambling landscape is fragmented by complex regulations, rapidly changing markets and promotional claims that can make meaningful comparisons difficult. Our mission is to build a data-informed, <strong>Geo-Aware Ranking Engine</strong> and independent research platform that helps readers explore relevant online casino information based on their region and individual research needs.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"about-card\">\n<h2>Who We Are</h2>\n<p>Level.casino is an independent digital publication operated by <strong>independent experts</strong> and serving an international audience. We combine technology, research, editorial analysis and practical comparisons to cover online casinos and the wider iGaming industry.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"about-standards\">\n<h2>The Level.casino Standard</h2>\n<p>We do not simply list casinos. We research and compare them. Our platform evaluates operators using multiple factors, including:</p>\n<ul class=\"about-metrics\">\n<li>Trust &amp; Licensing</li>\n<li>Payments &amp; Withdrawals</li>\n<li>Bonus Fairness</li>\n<li>Regional Availability</li>\n<li>Player-Facing Features</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Alongside casino research and comparisons, we publish industry news and developments covering the evolving iGaming market. Whether readers are researching casino availability in a specific country, comparing payment methods and bonuses, or following developments within the online gambling industry, Level.casino aims to provide useful information for independent research.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"about-cta\">\n<p>Interested in listing your brand, sharing industry information or discussing a commercial opportunity?</p>\n<a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"mailto:info@level.casino\">Contact Our Team</a></div>"}','About Us | Level.casino','Learn about Level.casino, the premier geo-aware casino ranking intelligence platform operated by independent experts.',0,1,'2026-07-11 19:37:45','2026-09-05 10:01:37',2,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "pages" ("id","slug","type","template","title","content_json","seo_title","seo_description","ai_generated","published","created_at","updated_at","author_id","created_by","seo_keywords") VALUES(10,'privacy','page','page','Privacy Policy','{"text":"<p>This Privacy Policy (&ldquo;Privacy Policy&rdquo;) relates to the website&nbsp;<strong>https://level.casino/</strong> and/or any sub-website and/or associated domains (and/or sub-domains) of https://level.casino/, including any other media form, media channel, mobile website, or mobile application related or connected thereto (hereinafter referred to as the &ldquo;Site&rdquo;).</p>\n<p>This Privacy Policy explains how We collect, use, safeguard, and disclose Your information when You visit Our Site. Additionally, it outlines Your rights regarding Your personal information.</p>\n<p>In this Privacy Policy, &ldquo;We&rdquo;, &ldquo;Us&rdquo;, &ldquo;Our&rdquo;, &ldquo;Ourselves&rdquo; and/or &ldquo;Level.casino&rdquo; refer to the operators of this Site, and &ldquo;You&rdquo;, &ldquo;Your&rdquo; and &ldquo;User&rdquo; refer to an identified or identifiable natural person being the user of this Site and/or client of any of Level.casino&rsquo;s services.</p>\n<div class=\"toc-box\">\n<h3>Table of Contents</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#control\">Who&rsquo;s in control of your information?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#changes\">Notification of changes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#data\">What is Personal Data?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#collection\">Collection of Your information</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#use\">Use of Your information</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#disclosure\">Disclosure of Your information</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#international\">International Transfers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#third-party\">Third-Party Websites</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#marketing\">Direct Marketing &amp; Social Media</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#minors\">Minors</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#security\">Security &amp; Data Retention</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#rights\">Your Rights &amp; Governing Law</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"control\">Who&rsquo;s in control of your information?</h2>\n<p>Level.casino is the data controller of Your information. We take the privacy of Our users seriously and it is Our duty to protect Your privacy and handle Your information in an open and transparent manner.</p>\n<p>Please read this Privacy Policy carefully. Should You not agree with its terms, kindly refrain from using the Site.</p>\n<p>Any external links to other websites or affiliate partners are clearly identifiable as such. We are not responsible for the content or privacy practices of external websites.</p>\n<h2 id=\"changes\">Notification of changes to this policy</h2>\n<p>We reserve the right to modify this Privacy Policy at any time and for any reason. Updates will take effect once published on this page, and the &ldquo;Last Updated&rdquo; date will reflect the latest version.</p>\n<h2 id=\"data\">What is Personal Data?</h2>\n<p>Personal Data refers to information that identifies You personally, such as Your name, birth date, e-mail address, or mailing address, and any other information that is associated with You personally. We collect Personal Data digitally via the Site, either when You voluntarily provide it to Us, automatically through browsing, or from third parties.</p>\n<h2 id=\"collection\">Collection of Your information</h2>\n<p>As a visitor, You do not have to submit any personal information to use the Site. However, We may collect personal data from You when You voluntarily interact with the Site. We may also collect anonymous information (e.g., Geo-IP location) to help improve the content, display relevant localized casinos, and ensure regulatory compliance.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>IP address, browser type, and language settings (used heavily for our Geo-aware ranking engine).</li>\n<li>Details of Your interactions with Our Site or services.</li>\n<li>Email addresses and correspondence if You contact Us directly.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"use\">Use of Your information</h2>\n<p>The personal information You provide Us may be used to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Provide a smooth, efficient, and customised experience based on your geographic location.</li>\n<li>Respond to Your requests or inquiries regarding the Site or domain acquisition.</li>\n<li>Perform internal statistical analysis and reporting for affiliate click-through rates.</li>\n<li>Comply with legal obligations and regional gambling compliance laws.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"disclosure\">Disclosure of Your information</h2>\n<p>We may disclose Your information if required by law or to comply with any legal process. We may share Your information with third parties that perform services for Us (e.g., analytics, hosting). As an affiliate platform, We may share anonymous click data with Our casino partners to verify referrals, subject to strict data protection standards.</p>\n<h2 id=\"international\">International Transfers &amp; Third-Party Websites</h2>\n<p>Some recipients of Your data may be located outside your jurisdiction. We ensure appropriate safeguards are in place. Furthermore, Level.casino contains tracking links to external casino operators. Once You click a &ldquo;Play Now&rdquo; or equivalent affiliate link, You are subject to the privacy policy of the destination operator.</p>\n<h2 id=\"marketing\">Direct Marketing &amp; Social Media</h2>\n<p>We may use Your personal data to send You promotions or information about products offered by Us or our partners. You always have the right to opt out of direct marketing by contacting Us at info@level.casino.</p>\n<h2 id=\"minors\">Minors</h2>\n<p>The Site and Our services are STRICTLY not intended for persons under the age of eighteen (18) or the legal gambling age in your jurisdiction. We do not knowingly collect personal data from minors.</p>\n<h2 id=\"security\">Security &amp; Data Retention</h2>\n<p>We employ appropriate technical, administrative, and physical safeguards to protect Your personal data. We retain Your personal data for as long as necessary to fulfil the purposes outlined in this Privacy Policy or to comply with legal obligations.</p>\n<h2 id=\"rights\">Your Rights &amp; Governing Law</h2>\n<p>You have the right to confirm whether We process Your personal data, request a copy, request deletion, or withdraw consent. To exercise these rights, contact Us.</p>\n<p>This Privacy Policy shall be governed by and construed in accordance with standard international data protection legislation (including GDPR where applicable).</p>\n<h3>Contact Details</h3>\n<p>Should You have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact Us at:<br><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:info@level.casino\">info@level.casino</a></p>"}','Privacy Policy | Level.casino','Privacy Policy for Level.casino. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your data on our geo-aware casino ranking platform.',0,1,'2026-07-11 19:55:10','2026-08-09 23:09:31',2,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "pages" ("id","slug","type","template","title","content_json","seo_title","seo_description","ai_generated","published","created_at","updated_at","author_id","created_by","seo_keywords") VALUES(11,'cookies','page','page','Cookie Policy','{"text":"<p>This cookie policy (&ldquo;Cookie Policy&rdquo;) refers to the website <strong>https://level.casino/</strong> and/or any sub-website and/or associated domains (and/or sub-domains) of https://level.casino/ (hereinafter referred to as the &ldquo;Site&rdquo;).</p>\n<p>This Cookie Policy forms part of our Privacy Policy, which provides more information about how We protect Users&rsquo; information. In this Cookie Policy, the terms &ldquo;Our&rdquo;, &ldquo;Ourselves&rdquo;, &ldquo;We&rdquo;, &ldquo;Us&rdquo;, and/or &ldquo;Level.casino&rdquo; refer to the operators of this Site.</p>\n<h2>Definition of Cookies</h2>\n<p>Cookies consist of small files that hold information about your browsing activity. Each time You visit a website, the website sends a cookie to the device You are using to access the website. Your device will then automatically store the cookie in a file located within Your web browser.</p>\n<h2>Why do we use Cookies?</h2>\n<p>Because Level.casino is a globally-facing, geo-aware casino ranking platform, cookies are essential. We use them to automatically detect your region so we can present you with legally compliant, locally available casino operators. They also ensure faster page load times and allow our affiliate tracking systems to correctly log referrals.</p>\n<h2>What cookies do we use and why?</h2>\n<h3>Necessary cookies</h3>\n<p>These cookies let You move around the Site and use its features securely. They are automatically placed on Your device. If You block these Cookies, it will break our geo-filtering system, potentially showing you unrestricted casinos not permitted in your jurisdiction.</p>\n<h3>Non-Compulsory Cookies</h3>\n<p><strong>Preferences:</strong> Used to remember your language selection or regional overrides if you manually select a different country filter.</p>\n<p><strong>Targeting/Affiliate Tracking:</strong> These Cookies collate information about Your browsing to ensure that when you click a &ldquo;Play Now&rdquo; button, the resulting operator correctly attributes the referral to Level.casino.</p>\n<p><strong>Statistics:</strong> These help Us collect information about Visitors, including Your geographic location, exactly when You access the Site, and how You found the Site. This information is held for analytical purposes.</p>\n<h2>Analytics &amp; Third-Party Cookies</h2>\n<p>We use analytic services to help Us understand how effective Our content is. Our main third-party Cookies include:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> You can deactivate Google Analytics using a browser add-on.</li>\n<li><strong>Affiliate Network Pixels:</strong> Supplied by our partners (e.g., SoftSwiss, Income Access) purely for conversion tracking.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Delete or Block Cookies</h2>\n<p>We respect Your right to privacy. If You do not wish cookies to be stored on Your computer, You can deactivate the relevant option in the system settings of Your browser. In most cases, You can refer to the &lsquo;Help&rsquo; section of Your browser (such as Chrome, Edge, or Safari) to learn how to change Your options regarding cookies.</p>\n<h3>Contact Details</h3>\n<p>Should You have any questions regarding Our Cookie Policy, You can contact Us by sending an email to <a href=\"mailto:info@level.casino\">info@level.casino</a>.</p>"}','Cookie Policy | Level.casino','Cookie Policy for Level.casino. Understand how we use cookies to provide geo-accurate casino rankings and track affiliate performance.',0,1,'2026-07-11 19:56:40','2026-08-09 23:10:02',2,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "pages" ("id","slug","type","template","title","content_json","seo_title","seo_description","ai_generated","published","created_at","updated_at","author_id","created_by","seo_keywords") VALUES(12,'responsible-gambling','page','page','Responsible Gambling','{"text":"<p>Gambling should always be a form of entertainment. However, for some, it can spiral into a serious concern that affects personal finances, relationships, and health. At <strong>Level.casino</strong>, we are committed to providing you with the tools and information required to maintain control and play safely.</p>\n<div class=\"rg-checklist\">\n<h3>Self-Assessment: Is Your Gambling Still a Game?</h3>\n<p>If you answer &ldquo;Yes&rdquo; to more than two of these questions, we recommend seeking professional support:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Do you gamble to escape from a boring or unhappy life?</li>\n<li>When gambling and you run out of money, do you feel lost and in despair and need to gamble again as soon as possible?</li>\n<li>Do you gamble until your last penny is gone, even the fare home or the cost of a cup of tea?</li>\n<li>Have you ever lied to cover up the amount of money or time you have spent gambling?</li>\n<li>Have others ever criticized your gambling?</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2>7 Tips for Safer Gambling</h2>\n<p>To ensure your experience remains positive, follow these industry-standard practices:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Don&rsquo;t think of gambling as a way to make money:</strong> The house always has an advantage in the long run.</li>\n<li><strong>Only gamble with money you can afford to lose:</strong> Never use money for rent, bills, or food.</li>\n<li><strong>Set a money limit in advance:</strong> Decide how much you can afford to lose before you start playing.</li>\n<li><strong>Set a time limit:</strong> It&rsquo;s easy to lose track of time when playing. Set a timer.</li>\n<li><strong>Never chase your losses:</strong> Chasing losses usually leads to bigger losses.</li>\n<li><strong>Don&rsquo;t gamble when you&rsquo;re depressed or upset:</strong> Decision-making is harder when you&rsquo;re under emotional stress.</li>\n<li><strong>Balance gambling with other activities:</strong> Don&rsquo;t let gambling become your only form of leisure.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Player Protection Tools</h2>\n<p>Most reputable operators ranked on <strong>Level.casino</strong> offer technical tools to help you stay safe. We prioritize ranking casinos that provide:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Deposit Limits:</strong> Restrict the amount you can deposit over a daily, weekly, or monthly period.</li>\n<li><strong>Loss Limits:</strong> Limit the amount of real money you can lose from the deposits you make.</li>\n<li><strong>Session Limits:</strong> A &ldquo;reality check&rdquo; that notifies you when you&rsquo;ve reached a certain time limit.</li>\n<li><strong>Self-Exclusion:</strong> A formal process where the operator closes your account for a period ranging from 6 months to 5 years.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Professional Support Organizations</h2>\n<p>If you or someone you know is struggling, these global organizations offer free, confidential advice:</p>\n<div class=\"help-grid\">\n<div class=\"help-card\">\n<h4>BeGambleAware</h4>\n<p>Confidential support and information for anyone in the UK.</p>\n<a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--sm\" href=\"https://www.begambleaware.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Visit Site</a></div>\n<div class=\"help-card\">\n<h4>Gamblers Anonymous</h4>\n<p>A fellowship of people who share their experience to solve their problem.</p>\n<a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--sm\" href=\"https://www.gamblersanonymous.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Visit Site</a></div>\n<div class=\"help-card\">\n<h4>GamCare</h4>\n<p>The leading provider of information, advice, and support in Great Britain.</p>\n<a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--sm\" href=\"https://www.gamcare.org.uk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Visit Site</a></div>\n<div class=\"help-card\">\n<h4>Gambling Therapy</h4>\n<p>Global online support for those residing outside the UK.</p>\n<a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--sm\" href=\"https://www.gamblingtherapy.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Visit Site</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2>Underage Gambling</h2>\n<p>It is illegal for anyone under the age of 18 (or the legal age in your jurisdiction) to open an account or to gamble at the casinos featured on our site. <strong>Level.casino</strong> reserves the right to request proof of age from any user and may block access to our ranking engine if age verification is not met.</p>"}','Responsible Gambling | Level.casino','Level.casino is committed to safe and responsible gaming. Learn how to stay in control and where to find support.',0,1,'2026-07-11 20:05:27','2026-08-09 23:10:30',2,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "pages" ("id","slug","type","template","title","content_json","seo_title","seo_description","ai_generated","published","created_at","updated_at","author_id","created_by","seo_keywords") VALUES(14,'editorial-policy','page','page','Level.casino editorial-policy','{"text":"<p>Level.casino is committed to providing accurate, transparent, and useful information about online casinos, gambling platforms, and the wider iGaming industry. Our editorial approach focuses on independent research, structured comparisons, and clear presentation of information to help readers make more informed decisions.</p>\n<h2>Our Editorial Approach</h2>\n<p>Our editorial team researches casino platforms and iGaming developments using relevant information available to us. Depending on the subject and availability of information, our research may include licensing and regulatory information, payment methods, games and software, security information, bonuses and promotional terms, player-facing features, customer support, country availability, responsible gambling tools, market developments, and other relevant sources.</p>\n<p>We aim to present information clearly and distinguish factual reporting, editorial analysis, and promotional information. Where information is subject to change or cannot be independently verified, we aim to make that limitation clear.</p>\n<h2>Independent Reviews and Comparisons</h2>\n<p>Level.casino operates independently from the gambling operators it covers. We do not operate online casinos, accept wagers, process gambling transactions, or manage player accounts.</p>\n<p>Our casino reviews and comparisons are based on editorial research and structured evaluation of relevant information. Rankings and ratings are intended to help readers compare operators using multiple information points rather than a single promotional offer or headline claim.</p>\n<p>Ratings and rankings are editorial assessments and should not be interpreted as guarantees of safety, availability, winnings, withdrawal outcomes, or future performance. Readers should consider the underlying information and verify important details directly with the relevant operator.</p>\n<h2>Editorial Independence</h2>\n<p>Level.casino may have commercial relationships with some gambling operators and other companies through qualifying affiliate partnerships or other legitimate commercial arrangements.</p>\n<p>Commercial relationships do not determine our editorial rankings, research methodology, factual reporting, or editorial conclusions. Where affiliate relationships are relevant, we provide appropriate disclosure so readers can understand the commercial relationship.</p>\n<h2>Content Accuracy and Updates</h2>\n<p>The online gambling industry changes frequently. Licensing status, casino availability, bonuses, payment methods, games, terms and conditions, and other operator information may change over time.</p>\n<p>We review and update content when relevant information changes or when updates are identified through our editorial processes. However, we cannot guarantee that every piece of information will remain current at all times.</p>\n<p>Readers should verify current licensing information, eligibility requirements, bonus conditions, payment and withdrawal terms, and jurisdictional restrictions directly with the relevant operator before registering or depositing.</p>\n<h2>Industry News and Analysis</h2>\n<p>Level.casino also publishes news and analysis covering the wider iGaming industry, including regulatory developments, licensing, market launches, mergers and acquisitions, technology, payments, gambling policy, and other significant developments.</p>\n<p>We aim to distinguish reported facts from analysis, forecasts, expectations, and other forward-looking information. Proposed transactions, regulatory proposals, and developing stories are identified according to their current status and should not be interpreted as completed events unless confirmed.</p>\n<h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>\n<p>Level.casino may receive compensation when readers visit partner websites through qualifying affiliate links or complete qualifying actions. Affiliate partnerships help support the operation, maintenance, research, and development of the platform.</p>\n<p>Affiliate compensation does not constitute regulatory approval, endorsement, or a guarantee that an operator is suitable for every reader. Commercial relationships do not override our commitment to transparent information, responsible gambling guidance, and editorial standards.</p>\n<h2>Responsible Gambling</h2>\n<p>Level.casino does not present gambling as a way to earn income or solve financial problems. Online gambling involves financial risk and can become harmful for some people.</p>\n<p>We encourage readers to understand the risks associated with gambling, use available responsible gambling tools, follow applicable laws and regulations, and only participate where online gambling is legally permitted.</p>\n<h2>Corrections and Feedback</h2>\n<p>We welcome feedback about factual errors, outdated information, broken links, or other issues affecting the accuracy of our content. When a material error is identified, we aim to investigate it and make an appropriate correction or update.</p>\n<p>Readers and industry representatives can contact the Level.casino team through our <a href=\"/en/contact\">Contact</a> page to report an issue or provide relevant information for editorial consideration.</p>\n<h2>Editorial Standards</h2>\n<p>Our editorial standards are designed to support accurate, useful, transparent, and responsible coverage of the online gambling industry. We aim to provide information that goes beyond promotional offers and affiliate links and helps readers better understand casino operators, markets, products, technologies, and industry developments.</p>"}','Level.casino Editorial Policy – Independent Casino Reviews & Research Standards','Learn how Level.casino creates independent casino reviews, evaluates operators, and maintains transparent editorial standards.',0,1,'2026-07-25 09:22:08','2026-09-05 12:43:20',1,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "pages" ("id","slug","type","template","title","content_json","seo_title","seo_description","ai_generated","published","created_at","updated_at","author_id","created_by","seo_keywords") VALUES(15,'review-methodology','page','page','Level.casino review-methodology','{"text":"<h1>Level.casino Casino Review Methodology</h1>\n\n<p>\nAt Level.casino, we use a structured review process to evaluate online casinos and provide visitors with detailed comparison information.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nOur methodology focuses on important factors that influence the overall quality, reliability, and user experience of an online casino.\n</p>\n\n<h2>Evaluation Criteria</h2>\n\n<p>\nEach casino review may consider the following areas:\n</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Licensing and Security:</strong> Available licensing information, security practices, and transparency.</li>\n\n<li><strong>Games and Software:</strong> Variety of casino games, software providers, slots, table games, and live casino options.</li>\n\n<li><strong>Payments:</strong> Available payment methods, transaction options, and withdrawal information.</li>\n\n<li><strong>User Experience:</strong> Website design, navigation, mobile compatibility, and overall usability.</li>\n\n<li><strong>Bonuses and Promotions:</strong> Available offers, promotions, and bonus conditions.</li>\n\n<li><strong>Customer Support:</strong> Support channels, availability, and quality of assistance.</li>\n\n<li><strong>Responsible Gambling:</strong> Availability of responsible gambling tools and information.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Review Updates</h2>\n\n<p>\nCasino information can change frequently. Our editorial team may update reviews when important changes occur, including changes to payment methods, promotions, ownership, licensing information, or available features.\n</p>\n\n<h2>Ratings and Rankings</h2>\n\n<p>\nRankings and ratings published on Level.casino are based on our editorial assessment of available information and may consider multiple factors rather than a single feature.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nUsers should always review the latest information directly with operators before creating an account or making financial decisions.\n</p>\n\n<h2>Transparency</h2>\n\n<p>\nLevel.casino aims to provide clear, informative, and responsible casino information while maintaining editorial independence.\n</p>"}','How Level.casino Reviews Online Casinos – Review Methodology','Discover how Level.casino evaluates online casinos using transparent review criteria including security, payments, games, and user experience.',0,1,'2026-07-25 09:25:51','2026-07-25 09:25:51',1,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "pages" ("id","slug","type","template","title","content_json","seo_title","seo_description","ai_generated","published","created_at","updated_at","author_id","created_by","seo_keywords") VALUES(16,'affiliate-disclosure','page','page','Affiliate Disclosure','{"text":"<p>Level.casino is an independent online casino information, comparison, research, and industry news platform. We may participate in affiliate partnerships with online casino operators and related companies. These commercial relationships help support the operation, maintenance, research, and development of our platform.</p>\n<h2>How Affiliate Partnerships Work</h2>\n<p>Some links on Level.casino may be affiliate links. When a visitor clicks a qualifying affiliate link and completes an eligible action with a partner website, Level.casino may receive compensation from that partner.</p>\n<p>Affiliate compensation may help fund website operations, editorial research, content production, technology, and ongoing development of the Level.casino platform.</p>\n<h2>Editorial Independence</h2>\n<p>Affiliate relationships do not guarantee a positive review, higher ranking, preferred placement, or favorable editorial conclusion.</p>\n<p>Our casino reviews, comparisons, ratings, rankings, and editorial content are based on our research methodology and the relevant information available to us. Commercial relationships do not determine our editorial rankings, research methodology, factual reporting, or editorial conclusions.</p>\n<p>Ratings and rankings are editorial assessments intended to help readers compare operators using multiple information points. They should not be interpreted as guarantees of safety, availability, winnings, withdrawal outcomes, or future performance.</p>\n<h2>Transparency and Commercial Relationships</h2>\n<p>Level.casino aims to distinguish editorial information from commercial relationships. Where affiliate relationships are relevant, we provide appropriate disclosure so readers can understand that Level.casino may receive compensation from qualifying referrals.</p>\n<p>Affiliate compensation does not constitute regulatory approval, endorsement, certification, or a guarantee that an operator is suitable for every reader.</p>\n<h2>Casino Information and Changes</h2>\n<p>Casino availability, licensing information, bonuses, payment methods, games, terms and conditions, withdrawal requirements, and other operator information may change over time and may differ between jurisdictions.</p>\n<p>Readers should verify current licensing information, eligibility requirements, promotional terms, payment and withdrawal conditions, and applicable legal restrictions directly with the relevant operator before registering or depositing.</p>\n<h2>Independent from Gambling Operators</h2>\n<p>Level.casino does not operate online casinos, accept wagers, process gambling transactions, or manage player accounts or player funds.</p>\n<p>Our role is to provide information, research, comparisons, and editorial coverage of online casinos and the wider iGaming industry. We encourage readers to evaluate information carefully and make their own decisions.</p>\n<h2>Responsible Gambling</h2>\n<p>Level.casino does not present gambling as a way to earn income or solve financial problems. Gambling involves financial risk and can become harmful for some people.</p>\n<p>We encourage readers to understand the risks associated with gambling, use available responsible gambling tools, follow applicable laws and regulations, and only participate where online gambling is legally permitted.</p>\n<p>For more information about responsible gambling and available support resources, visit our <a href=\"/en/responsible-gambling\">Responsible Gambling</a> page.</p>"}','Level.casino Affiliate Disclosure – Transparency Statement','Learn how Level.casino earns revenue through affiliate partnerships and how this affects our casino reviews.',0,1,'2026-07-25 09:29:46','2026-09-05 12:43:20',1,NULL,NULL);
INSERT INTO "pages" ("id","slug","type","template","title","content_json","seo_title","seo_description","ai_generated","published","created_at","updated_at","author_id","created_by","seo_keywords") VALUES(17,'team','page','page','Meet Our Team','{"text":"<h1>Meet the Level.casino Team</h1>\n\n<p>\nLevel.casino is built by a team focused on creating reliable casino comparison content, industry insights, and educational resources for users worldwide.\n</p>\n\n<h2>Elie Bizimana</h2>\n\n<p>\n<strong>Founder & Editor</strong>\n</p>\n\n<p>\nElie Bizimana is the founder of Level.casino and oversees the platform''s development, editorial direction, and content standards.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nHis work focuses on improving casino comparison tools, expanding international coverage, and building a transparent information platform for online casino research.\n</p>\n\n<h2>Editorial Team</h2>\n\n<p>\nThe Level.casino editorial team researches casino operators, reviews industry developments, updates platform information, and creates educational content to help visitors make informed decisions.\n</p>\n\n<h2>Our Mission</h2>\n\n<p>\nOur mission is to provide accurate, transparent, and regularly updated casino information through independent reviews, comparisons, and responsible gambling resources.\n</p>\n\n<p>\nLevel.casino does not operate gambling services or accept bets. We provide information and comparisons to help users better understand the online casino industry.\n</p>"}','Level.casino Team – Meet Our Editorial Team','Meet the team behind Level.casino and learn about our approach to casino research, reviews, and industry content.',0,1,'2026-07-25 09:32:30','2026-07-25 09:32:30',1,NULL,NULL);
