;white-space:nowrap;">\n      Social Casinos\n    </a>\n\n<a href="/en/category/sweepstakes-casinos" style="display:block;flex:0 0 auto;padding:11px 17px;background:#fffaf0;border:1px solid #c49a32;border-radius:9px;color:#382900;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;white-space:nowrap;">\n      Sweepstakes Casinos\n    </a>\n\n    <a href="/en/category/sportsbook-casinos" style="display:block;flex:0 0 auto;padding:11px 17px;background:#fffaf0;border:1px solid #c49a32;border-radius:9px;color:#382900;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;white-space:nowrap;">\n      Sportsbook\n    </a>\n\n  </div>\n</div>','\n',char(10)),NULL,'active','2026-08-29 04:18:19','2026-09-01 19:48:42');
INSERT INTO "components" ("id","name","slug","type","title","content","settings_json","status","created_at","updated_at") VALUES(54,'Platform – How Level.casino Works','platform-how-it-works','text','How Level.casino Works',replace('Level.casino combines structured casino data, editorial reviews, country-specific information, rankings and AI-powered assistance to help users discover and compare online casinos.\n\nCasino Data\n\nWe maintain structured information about casino operators, including available games, payment methods, licensing information, currencies and other important details.\n\nReviews & Rankings\n\nOur casino reviews and rankings are designed to help users compare operators using consistent editorial information and evaluation criteria.\n\nCountry & GEO Information\n\nCasino availability and relevance can vary by country. Level.casino uses country-aware information to help users discover casinos and gambling resources relevant to their location.\n\nLummet AI\n\nLummet AI provides a conversational way to explore casinos, reviews, news and general gambling information across the Level.casino platform.\n\nThe platform is continuously updated as new data, features and improvements are introduced.','\n',char(10)),NULL,'active','2026-08-29 11:52:16','2026-08-29 11:52:16');
INSERT INTO "components" ("id","name","slug","type","title","content","settings_json","status","created_at","updated_at") VALUES(55,'Platform – What We Are Improving','platform-improvements','text','What We''re Improving',replace('Level.casino is continuously evolving. Our platform improvements focus on making casino discovery, comparison and information easier to understand.\n\nBetter Casino Discovery\n\nWe are improving search, categories, filters and recommendations so users can find relevant casino information more efficiently.\n\nMore Useful Rankings\n\nWe continue to improve the way casino information is organized and presented, with a focus on clearer comparisons and useful ranking signals.\n\nBetter GEO Personalization\n\nCountry-specific information is an important part of Level.casino. We continue to expand and improve localized casino discovery and country coverage.\n\nImproved Reviews & Data\n\nCasino profiles and reviews are regularly developed and updated as information changes, helping users access more useful and current operator information.\n\nSmarter AI Assistance\n\nLummet AI is being developed to make it easier to explore Level.casino through natural-language questions and conversational discovery.\n\nFaster & Better User Experience\n\nWe continuously work on navigation, mobile usability, performance and the overall experience across the platform.','\n',char(10)),NULL,'active','2026-08-29 11:54:57','2026-08-29 11:54:57');
INSERT INTO "components" ("id","name","slug","type","title","content","settings_json","status","created_at","updated_at") VALUES(56,'Platform – What''s Next','platform-roadmap','text','What''s Next for Level.casino',replace('What''s Next for Level.casino?\n\nLevel.casino is an actively developing platform. Future improvements will focus on making casino research, comparison and discovery more useful for users around the world.\n\nExpanding Casino & Country Coverage\n\nWe plan to continue expanding structured casino information and country-specific coverage across more markets.\n\nMore Powerful Casino Discovery\n\nFuture improvements will make it easier to discover casinos through rankings, categories, filters and personalized information.\n\nContinued Lummet AI Development\n\nLummet AI will continue to evolve with improved conversational discovery and deeper integration with Level.casino content.\n\nBetter Reviews & Comparisons\n\nWe are continuing to develop our review, ranking and comparison experience to make important casino information easier to evaluate.\n\nOngoing Platform Improvements\n\nPerformance, mobile experience, navigation, data quality and usability will remain ongoing areas of development.\n\nPlatform plans may change as new requirements, technology and user needs emerge. Major completed improvements are published here as Platform Updates.','\n',char(10)),NULL,'active','2026-08-29 11:57:03','2026-08-29 11:57:03');
INSERT INTO "components" ("id","name","slug","type","title","content","settings_json","status","created_at","updated_at") VALUES(57,'Casino Listing – How We Rank','casino-listing-how-we-rank','text','How We Rank Online Casinos',replace('How We Rank Online Casinos\n\nLevel.casino organizes online casinos using structured information and editorial evaluation criteria designed to make comparison easier.\n\nOur rankings can consider factors such as available games, payment methods, licensing information, casino features, user experience, country availability and other relevant information contained in our casino database.\n\nRankings are not a guarantee that a casino is suitable for every player. Casino information, availability, promotions and terms can change, so users should always verify current details directly with the operator before registering or depositing.','\n',char(10)),NULL,'active','2026-08-29 12:05:05','2026-08-29 12:05:05');
INSERT INTO "components" ("id","name","slug","type","title","content","settings_json","status","created_at","updated_at") VALUES(58,'Casino Listing – Find Your Casino','casino-listing-find-your-casino','text','Find the Right Online Casino',replace('Find the Right Online Casino\n\nEvery player can have different priorities when comparing online casinos. Level.casino lets you explore operators by features, categories and country-specific information.\n\nLooking for Crypto Casinos?\n\nExplore casinos that support cryptocurrency and other digital payment options.\n\nPrefer Live Dealer Games?\n\nDiscover casinos with live dealer tables and real-time casino games.\n\nWant New Casinos?\n\nBrowse recently launched operators and explore their available features.\n\nComparing Casino Reviews?\n\nRead detailed casino reviews before deciding which operators are worth investigating further.\n\nNeed Country-Specific Options?\n\nExplore casino information by country to find operators and resources relevant to your market.','\n',char(10)),NULL,'active','2026-08-29 12:06:56','2026-08-29 12:06:56');
INSERT INTO "components" ("id","name","slug","type","title","content","settings_json","status","created_at","updated_at") VALUES(59,'Casino Listing – Explore by Category and Country','casino-listing-category-country','text','Explore Casinos by Category & Country',replace('Explore Casinos by Category & Country\n\nExplore the Level.casino directory using categories and country-specific pages.\n\nPopular Casino Categories\n\nCrypto Casinos · Live Dealer Casinos · Slot-Focused Casinos · New Casinos · Sportsbook Casinos\n\nBrowse by Country\n\nExplore casino information for your country and compare operators based on available information, features and market availability.\n\nVisit our country directory to explore casino information across international markets.','\n',char(10)),NULL,'active','2026-08-29 12:08:38','2026-08-29 12:08:38');
INSERT INTO "components" ("id","name","slug","type","title","content","settings_json","status","created_at","updated_at") VALUES(60,'Review Listing – How We Review','review-listing-how-we-review','text','How We Review Online Casinos',replace('How We Review Online Casinos\n\nLevel.casino reviews are designed to give readers a structured way to evaluate online casino operators. Our editorial process considers information such as licensing, games, payment methods, user experience, country availability, security information and other relevant casino features.\n\nWe organize this information into consistent review sections so that readers can compare different operators more easily.\n\nCasino information can change over time. Promotions, payment methods, available games, licensing details and country restrictions may change without notice, so readers should verify important terms directly with the operator before registering or depositing.','\n',char(10)),NULL,'active','2026-08-29 12:13:20','2026-08-29 12:13:20');
INSERT INTO "components" ("id","name","slug","type","title","content","settings_json","status","created_at","updated_at") VALUES(61,'Review Listing – What We Check','review-listing-what-we-check','text','What We Check in Every Casino Review',replace('What We Check in Every Casino Review\n\nOur reviews bring together important information that can help readers research an online casino.\n\nLicensing & Regulation\n\nWe look for available licensing and regulatory information and identify the jurisdiction associated with the operator where information is available.\n\nGames & Software\n\nWe examine the types of casino games and software providers available, including slots, table games and live casino where applicable.\n\nPayments\n\nWe review available deposit and withdrawal methods, supported currencies and other publicly available payment information.\n\nBonuses & Promotions\n\nWhere applicable, we provide information about advertised bonuses and promotions while highlighting that terms, eligibility and wagering requirements can change.\n\nUser Experience\n\nWe consider website usability, navigation, mobile experience and the availability of useful casino information.\n\nCountry Availability\n\nCasino availability can differ by jurisdiction. Our reviews consider publicly available information about supported and restricted markets.\n\nResponsible Gambling\n\nWe look for responsible gambling information and tools provided by the operator, including relevant self-exclusion or player-protection resources where available.','\n',char(10)),NULL,'active','2026-08-29 12:15:24','2026-08-29 12:15:24');
INSERT INTO "components" ("id","name","slug","type","title","content","settings_json","status","created_at","updated_at") VALUES(62,'Review Listing – How to Use Reviews','review-listing-how-to-use','text','How to Use Our Casino Reviews',replace('How to Use Our Casino Reviews\n\nUse Level.casino reviews as a starting point for researching and comparing online casinos.\n\nStart by looking at the casino''s overall review and the areas that matter most to you, such as licensing, available games, payment methods, country availability and user experience.\n\nYou can then compare several reviews to identify differences between operators. For country-specific information, use our country pages, and for broader discovery, explore the casino directory and casino categories.\n\nOur reviews provide informational and comparison content. They are not a recommendation to gamble or a guarantee of an operator''s suitability, safety or future availability.','\n',char(10)),NULL,'active','2026-08-29 12:17:31','2026-08-29 12:17:31');
INSERT INTO "components" ("id","name","slug","type","title","content","settings_json","status","created_at","updated_at") VALUES(63,'News Listing – About Our News','news-listing-about','text','iGaming News & Industry Updates',replace('iGaming News & Industry Updates\n\nLevel.casino News covers important developments across the online gambling and iGaming industry. Our coverage includes online casinos, sports betting, regulation, payments, technology, artificial intelligence, cryptocurrency and major developments in gambling markets around the world.\n\nWe aim to provide timely, informative coverage that helps readers understand what is changing in the global iGaming industry.\n\nBrowse our latest stories or explore news by topic and market to find developments relevant to you.','\n',char(10)),NULL,'active','2026-08-29 12:24:38','2026-08-29 12:24:38');
INSERT INTO "components" ("id","name","slug","type","title","content","settings_json","status","created_at","updated_at") VALUES(64,'News Listing – Coverage','news-listing-coverage','text','What We Cover',replace('\nOur news coverage spans the major areas shaping the modern iGaming industry.\n\nRegulation & Licensing\n\nFollow regulatory changes, licensing developments, enforcement actions and gambling legislation across major markets.\n\nOnline Casinos & Sports Betting\n\nStay informed about major operator launches, market developments, acquisitions, partnerships and industry activity.\n\niGaming Technology\n\nDiscover developments in artificial intelligence, casino technology, platforms, software, payments and emerging digital tools.\n\nCryptocurrency & Payments\n\nFollow developments involving cryptocurrency casinos, digital payments, payment providers and changing payment regulations.\n\nGlobal Markets\n\nExplore important developments across European, North American, Latin American, African and Asian gambling markets.\n\nIndustry Trends\n\nUnderstand emerging trends that could influence online gambling, casino technology, sports betting and the wider iGaming ecosystem.','\n',char(10)),NULL,'active','2026-08-29 12:26:59','2026-08-29 12:26:59');
INSERT INTO "components" ("id","name","slug","type","title","content","settings_json","status","created_at","updated_at") VALUES(65,'News Listing – Editorial Approach','news-listing-editorial-approach','text','Our Approach to iGaming News',replace('Our Approach to iGaming News\n\nWe focus on reporting developments that are relevant to online gambling players, industry professionals and anyone following the global iGaming market.\n\nOur editorial coverage aims to distinguish reported facts from analysis and commentary. When reporting on regulatory decisions, market developments, company announcements or other significant events, we seek to use reliable and relevant sources.\n\nNews can develop quickly. Information, regulations, market conditions and company announcements may change after publication, so readers should consider the publication date and verify important information with the relevant official source.\n\nFor more information about how Level.casino produces and maintains editorial content, see our Editorial Policy.','\n',char(10)),NULL,'active','2026-08-29 12:34:03','2026-08-29 12:34:03');
INSERT INTO "components" ("id","name","slug","type","title","content","settings_json","status","created_at","updated_at") VALUES(66,'Category Listing – Explore Categories','category-listing-explore','text','Explore Online Casino Categories',replace('Explore Online Casino Categories\n\nLevel.casino organizes online casinos into categories based on their games, features, payment options and overall offering. Browse our category pages to discover casinos that match different playing preferences and interests.\n\nWhether you are looking for cryptocurrency casinos, live dealer platforms, slot-focused casinos, new online casinos or casino and sportsbook combinations, our category guides provide a starting point for comparing relevant operators.\n\nExplore a category to see available casinos, read reviews and learn more about the features that distinguish each group.','\n',char(10)),NULL,'active','2026-08-29 12:41:15','2026-08-29 12:41:15');
INSERT INTO "components" ("id","name","slug","type","title","content","settings_json","status","created_at","updated_at") VALUES(67,'Category Listing – Popular Categories','category-listing-popular','text','Popular Online Casino Categories',replace('Popular Online Casino Categories\n\nCrypto Casinos\n\nExplore online casinos that support cryptocurrency and digital payment options.\n\nLive Dealer Casinos\n\nDiscover casinos offering live dealer games with real-time dealers and interactive tables.\n\nSlot-Focused Casinos\n\nFind casinos with extensive selections of online slots and slot-focused gaming libraries.\n\nNew Casinos\n\nExplore recently launched online casino platforms and compare their available features.\n\nCasino & Sportsbook Combos\n\nDiscover platforms that combine casino gaming with sports betting services.','\n',char(10)),NULL,'active','2026-08-29 12:43:34','2026-08-29 12:43:34');
INSERT INTO "components" ("id","name","slug","type","title","content","settings_json","status","created_at","updated_at") VALUES(68,'Category Listing – How to Choose','category-listing-how-to-choose','text','How to Choose the Right Casino Category',replace('\n\nThe right casino category depends on the features and games you are looking for.\n\nIf cryptocurrency payments are important to you, start with crypto casinos. Players interested in interactive table games can explore live dealer casinos, while players primarily interested in slots can browse slot-focused operators.\n\nIf you want to investigate recently launched platforms, explore new casinos. For users interested in both casino games and sports betting, casino and sportsbook combinations provide another option.\n\nBefore registering with any operator, check its current licensing information, country availability, payment options, terms and responsible gambling tools. Availability and conditions can vary by jurisdiction and can change over time.','\n',char(10)),NULL,'active','2026-08-29 12:48:46','2026-08-29 12:48:46');
INSERT INTO "components" ("id","name","slug","type","title","content","settings_json","status","created_at","updated_at") VALUES(69,'Country Listing – Explore Countries','country-listing-explore','text','Explore Online Casinos by Country',replace('\n\nOnline casino availability, licensing requirements, payment methods and gambling regulations can vary significantly from one country to another. Level.casino organizes casino information by country to make it easier to explore operators and gambling markets relevant to different locations.\n\nSelect a country to explore available casino information, local market details, casino reviews and relevant gambling resources.\n\nOur country pages are designed as a starting point for research. Always check the current legal requirements, operator licensing, eligibility rules and availability that apply to your location before using an online gambling service.','\n',char(10)),NULL,'active','2026-08-29 12:53:38','2026-08-29 12:53:38');
INSERT INTO "components" ("id","name","slug","type","title","content","settings_json","status","created_at","updated_at") VALUES(70,'Country Listing – Why Country Matters','country-listing-why-country-matters','text','Why Your Country Matters',replace('\nAn online casino that is available in one market may not be available in another. Local regulations, licensing requirements, payment methods, currencies and operator restrictions can all affect which casinos users can access.\n\nLicensing & Regulation :  \n  \n\nDifferent countries and jurisdictions have different approaches to online gambling regulation and licensing.\n\nCasino Availability:  \n\n\nOperators may accept players from some countries while restricting access from others.\n\nPayment Methods:   \n\n\nPopular deposit and withdrawal methods can vary by market, as can supported currencies and transaction options.\n\nLocal Requirements:   \n\n\nAge requirements, identity verification, responsible gambling rules and other requirements can differ between jurisdictions.\n\nMarket-Specific Information:   \n\n\nOur country pages bring relevant casino and gambling information together for individual markets, making it easier to research your options.','\n',char(10)),NULL,'active','2026-08-29 13:47:28','2026-08-29 13:47:28');
INSERT INTO "components" ("id","name","slug","type","title","content","settings_json","status","created_at","updated_at") VALUES(71,'Country Listing – Global Markets','country-listing-global-markets','text','Browse Casino Markets Around the World',replace('\nExplore online casino information across markets in Europe, North America, Latin America, Africa, Asia and other regions.  \n\nChoose your country from the directory to find market-specific information and relevant casino resources. Country coverage continues to expand as Level.casino develops its international casino database.  \n\nFor each market, check the applicable regulations, licensing information, operator availability and local requirements before making any decision to register or deposit.','\n',char(10)),NULL,'active','2026-08-29 13:49:59','2026-08-29 13:49:59');
