INSERT INTO "user_inquiries" ("id","user_id","subject","message","status","admin_reply","created_at","updated_at") VALUES(6,1,'Updates ',replace('Yes. Since you''re building your own CMS on Cloudflare, you can make it feel like a modern publishing platform (similar to WordPress, Notion, or Google Docs). I''d focus on four major improvements:\n\n1. Rich Text Editor (highest priority)\n\nReplace the plain <textarea> with a full WYSIWYG editor. This gives editors buttons for:\n\nBold, italic, underline\n\nFont size and headings (H1, H2, H3...)\n\nText color and highlighting\n\nLists and tables\n\nImage insertion\n\nVideo embedding\n\nLinks\n\nBlockquotes\n\nCode blocks\n\nUndo/redo\n\nDrag-and-drop images\n\n\nGood open-source editors include:\n\nTiptap (modern and highly customizable)\n\nCKEditor 5\n\nTinyMCE\n\nQuill\n\n\nFor Level.casino, Tiptap or CKEditor 5 would be excellent choices.\n\n\n---\n\n2. Cloudflare Images\n\nInstead of storing uploaded images in your project folder, upload them to Cloudflare Images.\n\nBenefits:\n\nAutomatic optimization\n\nGlobal CDN delivery\n\nMultiple image sizes\n\nFast loading\n\nEasy insertion into articles\n\n\nEditors could simply click Insert Image, upload a file, and it would appear in the article.\n\n\n---\n\n3. Cloudflare R2 for Videos & Files\n\nFor larger assets, use Cloudflare R2.\n\nStore:\n\nVideos\n\nPDFs\n\nZIP files\n\nDocuments\n\nDownloads\n\n\nAdvantages:\n\nLarge storage\n\nNo egress fees when served through Cloudflare\n\nFast worldwide delivery\n\n\n\n---\n\n4. Media Library\n\nCreate a media page in your CMS.\n\nEditors can:\n\nUpload images\n\nUpload videos\n\nSearch media\n\nCopy URLs\n\nReuse existing files\n\nDelete unused media\n\n\nJust like WordPress'' Media Library.\n\n\n---\n\nYour future publishing workflow\n\n1. Click New Article\n\n\n2. Enter title\n\n\n3. Write in a Word-like editor\n\n\n4. Click Insert Image\n\n\n5. Upload to Cloudflare Images\n\n\n6. Image appears instantly\n\n\n7. Save\n\n\n8. Publish\n\n\n\nNo manual HTML or CSS needed for normal articles.\n\n\n---\n\nLong-term vision for Level.casino\n\nYou could build a professional editorial system with:\n\n✅ Rich text editor\n\n✅ Image uploads\n\n✅ Video uploads\n\n✅ Drag-and-drop media\n\n✅ AI writing assistant\n\n✅ SEO analyzer\n\n✅ Internal link suggestions\n\n✅ Auto-save drafts\n\n✅ Revision history\n\n✅ Scheduled publishing\n\n✅ Author profiles\n\n✅ Featured image selection\n\n✅ Responsive image generation\n\n✅ Markdown import/export\n\n✅ One-click casino card insertion\n\n✅ One-click comparison tables\n\n✅ Automatic table of contents\n\n✅ Reading time calculation\n\n\nThis would make Level.casino''s CMS comparable to professional publishing platforms while remaining tailored specifically for iGaming reviews and news.','\n',char(10)),'pending',NULL,'2026-07-25 17:56:26','2026-07-25 17:56:26');
INSERT INTO "user_notifications" ("id","user_id","title","message","link","is_read","created_at","severity","category","related_resource","related_id","expires_at") VALUES(1,3,'New Editor Guide ',replace('Level.casino Editor Guide\n\nWelcome to Level.casino\n\nLevel.casino is an independent online casino comparison, review, and iGaming news platform. We do not operate an online casino or accept bets. Our job is to help players make informed decisions by publishing honest reviews, research, and industry news.\n\nThe more useful and trustworthy our website becomes, the more people visit it. When visitors click our affiliate links and register or play at one of our listed casino partners, Level.casino may earn a commission. This helps us continue improving the platform and publishing quality content.\n\n---\n\nHow Level.casino Gets Visitors\n\nThere are several ways people discover Level.casino.\n\n1. Google Search (SEO)\n\nThis is our biggest source of visitors.\n\nWhen people search for terms like:\n\n- Best online casinos\n- Casino reviews\n- Crypto casinos\n- Online gambling news\n- Fast payout casinos\n\nGoogle may show Level.casino in its search results.\n\nGoogle does this because it believes our content is useful and trustworthy.\n\nExamples of content that helps us rank:\n\n- Casino reviews\n- Casino comparison pages\n- Industry news\n- Educational articles\n- Responsible gambling guides\n- Payment method guides\n\nOur goal is to answer real questions that players ask.\n\n---\n\n2. Casino Reviews\n\nCasino reviews are one of the most important parts of Level.casino.\n\nEditors research each casino carefully before publishing.\n\nA good review should include:\n\n- Company background\n- Licensing information\n- Games\n- Bonuses\n- Banking methods\n- Withdrawal speed\n- Customer support\n- Mobile experience\n- Security\n- Advantages\n- Disadvantages\n- Overall opinion\n\nReviews should always be balanced, honest, and based on research.\n\n---\n\n3. News and Industry Articles\n\nWe also publish news and educational articles about the iGaming industry.\n\nExamples include:\n\n- AI in online casinos\n- Responsible gambling\n- Casino payment methods\n- New technologies\n- Industry trends\n- Regulation updates\n- Mobile gaming\n- African iGaming growth\n\nThese articles help both players and search engines understand that Level.casino is an industry research platform.\n\n---\n\n4. Social Media\n\nQuality content can also be shared on:\n\n- Facebook\n- X (Twitter)\n- LinkedIn\n- WhatsApp\n- Telegram\n- Reddit\n- Other relevant communities\n\nSharing useful articles helps more people discover Level.casino.\n\nNever post spam.\n\nAlways share helpful content that people will actually want to read.\n\n---\n\n5. Backlinks\n\nBacklinks are links from other websites pointing to Level.casino.\n\nExample:\n\nhttps://level.casino/en/casino\n\nor\n\nhttps://level.casino/en/review\n\nA good backlink is created by writing a useful article (around 500 words or more) on another trusted website, naturally including a link to Level.casino.\n\nGood backlinks improve our reputation and may help our Google rankings.\n\nQuality is always more important than quantity.\n\n---\n\nHow Editors Join Level.casino\n\nIf you want to become an editor, these are the normal steps.\n\nStep 1\n\nCreate a Level.casino account.\n\nEvery new user starts with a Viewer account.\n\n---\n\nStep 2\n\nThe administrator reviews your application.\n\n---\n\nStep 3\n\nIf approved, your account is upgraded to Editor.\n\n---\n\nStep 4\n\nThe administrator creates an Author Profile for you.\n\nEvery article you publish will be connected to your author profile, helping readers know who wrote the content.\n\n---\n\nStep 5\n\nThe administrator gives you the permissions you need.\n\nDepending on your role, you may be allowed to:\n\n- Create news articles\n- Edit articles\n- Publish content\n- Upload images\n- Improve SEO information\n- Manage other editorial tasks\n\n---\n\nWhat Makes a Good Editor?\n\nA good editor always:\n\n- Writes original content.\n- Checks facts before publishing.\n- Uses clear and simple English.\n- Does proper research.\n- Adds useful internal links where appropriate.\n- Uses trusted external sources when needed.\n- Avoids copying content from other websites.\n- Supports responsible gambling.\n- Maintains a professional tone.\n\n---\n\nWhy Quality Matters\n\nGoogle rewards websites that consistently publish helpful, trustworthy, and well-researched content.\n\nOne excellent article is often more valuable than many short or low-quality articles.\n\nOur goal is to build long-term trust with:\n\n- Readers\n- Search engines\n- Casino operators\n- Affiliate partners\n- Industry organizations\n\nBy maintaining high editorial standards, Level.casino can continue to grow, attract more visitors, and create more opportunities for everyone who contributes to the platform.\n\nTogether, we are building a trusted source of iGaming knowledge for players around the world.','\n',char(10)),NULL,0,'2026-07-25 17:34:04','info',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL);
